---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue | Knit by Machine";
const pageDescription = "Get unstuck, get moving, and finally finish—one doable step at a time. A 10-day, call-free experience with personalized guidance from Sue.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <div class="sales-page">
    
    <section class="hero-section">
      <h1 data-testid="text-page-title">10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue</h1>
      <p class="tagline" data-testid="text-tagline">Get unstuck, get moving, and finally finish—one doable step at a time.</p>
      <p class="intro-text" data-testid="text-intro">
        If your project is sitting half-done—and you're tired of feeling stuck—this 10-day, call-free experience gives you a clear plan and gentle accountability. You choose the project, Sue breaks it into small steps, and you move forward at your own pace. No calls. No pressure. Just progress you can feel.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#pricing" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-hero">
          Start Your 10-Day Finish-It Plan
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-who">Is This for You?</h2>
      <p>This 10-day, no-call coaching is designed for knitters who want calm, practical support without the pressure of calls or video meetings. It's a great fit if:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list" data-testid="list-who">
        <li>You have a project that's been sitting half-done for weeks (or months).</li>
        <li>You're overwhelmed, frustrated, or not sure what the next step should be.</li>
        <li>You want support—but not calls, meetings, or pressure.</li>
        <li>You work best at your own pace and on your own schedule.</li>
        <li>You want a short, structured plan to help you build momentum and actually finish.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-what">What You'll Get</h2>
      <p>During your 10 days, you'll receive focused, personalized support to keep you moving forward:</p>
      
      <div class="benefits-list" data-testid="list-benefits">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>A clear, custom plan for your project</h3>
          <p>Sue will break your project into small, manageable steps based on where you are right now—so you know exactly what to do next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Guidance without calls</h3>
          <p>Check in when you're ready, and Sue will respond with clear, practical advice—no scheduling, no video, no waiting for an appointment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Gentle accountability</h3>
          <p>Sometimes you just need someone in your corner. Sue is here to encourage you, celebrate small wins, and help you stay on track.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Practical help when you get stuck</h3>
          <p>If something doesn't look right, doesn't feel right, or you're just not sure—Sue will help you figure it out and move forward.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-pricing">10 Days of Private, No-Call Coaching — $___</h2>
      <p class="pricing-intro">
        A short, focused container designed to help you finish with clarity, momentum, and support that fits your schedule.
      </p>
      <ul class="feature-list pricing-features" data-testid="list-pricing-features">
        <li>A personalized plan for your project</li>
        <li>Private, asynchronous guidance from Sue</li>
        <li>Clear next steps each time you check in</li>
        <li>Troubleshooting when something doesn't look or feel right</li>
        <li>Gentle accountability so you keep moving forward</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-pricing">
          Start Your 10-Day Finish-It Plan
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-faq">Quick Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q1">Do I have to check in every day?</h3>
        <p>No. There’s no minimum requirement. Some people check in every day; others send updates every few days. Whatever works for you is fine.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q2">What if life gets busy?</h3>
        <p>The 10 days are meant to be flexible. If you need to pause, just let Sue know—she'll help you pick back up when you're ready.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q3">Is this good for beginners?</h3>
        <p>Yes. Whether you're brand new or have been knitting for years, this coaching meets you where you are. Sue adjusts her guidance based on your experience.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="final-cta-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-final">Ready to finally finish?</h2>
      <p class="final-cta-text">
        10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue — one project, ten days, and calm, call-free support to help you move forward.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#pricing" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-final">
          Start Your 10-Day Finish-It Plan
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sales-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .hero-section h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .cta-wrapper {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .kbm-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .kbm-button--primary {
    background-color: #52682d;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .kbm-button--primary:hover {
    background-color: #445626;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .content-section h2,
  .pricing-section h2,
  .faq-section h2,
  .final-cta-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p,
  .pricing-section p,
  .faq-section p,
  .final-cta-section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .feature-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.5em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .benefits-list {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .benefit-item {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .benefit-item h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-item p {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1f6ec 0%, #e9ece7 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height, 6rem) + 1rem);
  }

  .pricing-section h2 {
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pricing-intro {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-features {
    max-width: 450px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .faq-section {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .final-cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .final-cta-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .final-cta-text {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sales-page {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .pricing-section {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .benefit-item {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .kbm-button {
      padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
